    a_{m,r,s} = a_{m,r,s}\left(t, e_0, e_1', e_2', \widehat{\ell}\right) := 
    \mathbbm{1}_{b e_1'e_2' \mid r}
    \mathbbm{1}_{\substack{r/(be_1'e_2') \equiv \widehat{\ell} \\ \pmod{te_0e_1'e_2'}}}
    \mathbbm{1}_{s \mid te_0}
    \sum_{\substack{h_1, h_2 \sim H \\ h_1e_1' - h_2e_2' = m}} 
    \xi_{h_1, h_2},
\]
