\end{aligned}
\]
Recalling that $J \ll (K T E^2 x^\eta)/(NE_0)$ (from \cref{lem:splitting-bfi}), $M_{\neq} \ll HEL/(E_0 L_0)$ and $R_{\neq} \asymp x^{O(\eta)} L^2 E^2 / (L_0 E_0^2)$ (from \cref{eq:bneq-bound}), this yields
